OL,3,GNEWSAThe NHS mum preparing to be part
OL,4,Aof British baseball history
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen British baseball history is made
OL,7,Fthis Sunday, one of the team, Betheliza
OL,8,FDela Paz, will be reflecting how she
OL,9,Fbalanced training for the Women's
OL,10,FBaseball World Cup with juggling an NHS
OL,11,Fjob and raising her children.
OL,13,FThe mum-of-three described her
OL,14,Fselection for the Great Britain (GB)
OL,15,Fteam as "an amazing journey", which
OL,16,Fbegan when she played softball growing
OL,17,Fup in the Philippines.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
