OL,3,GNEWSAThe NHS mum preparing to be part
OL,4,Aof British baseball history
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe loved baseball but said it was only
OL,7,Fthe boys who played the sport: "The
OL,8,Fonly pathway for girls was fast-pitch
OL,9,Fsoftball and that's what I played
OL,10,Fgrowing up and I fully enjoyed it."
OL,12,FDela Paz moved to the UK in 2011 and
OL,13,Ftook up a job in the NHS as a surgical
OL,14,Fcare practitioner but continued her
OL,15,Flove for the sport.
